phi-adapter-fritz (0.0~git202608201112.f8f8424-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Split the single-translation-unit sidecar into fritz_tr064, fritz_http,
    fritz_schema, fritz_runtime_convert, fritz_sidecar and main (F-34). The SOAP
    parsers were private statics on the instance and are now pure functions on the
    protocol; the blocking transport is FritzHttp, which takes a cancel probe so the
    F-33 cancellable wait belongs to the client.
  * Remove a dead duplicate of the config schema builder (~130 lines, no caller).
  * No behaviour change: descriptor, config.changed frames and sidecar stderr are
    identical to the pre-split binary.

 -- Marius Schumacher <marius.schumacher@phisys.com>  Thu, 20 Aug 2026 11:12:25 +0200

