phi-adapter-fritz (0.0~git202608191934.1eb8589-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Abort in-flight SOAP calls when the adapter is stopping: the nested request
    loop polls the stop request, and the per-host loop no longer runs for
    total x 3s after a stop (F-33).
  * Rebuild against phi-adapter-sdk 0.5.0.

 -- Marius Schumacher <marius.schumacher@phisys.com>  Wed, 19 Aug 2026 18:10:56 +0200

phi-adapter-fritz (0.0~git20260819.99c39eb-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Run adapter instances on a Qt execution backend: the blocking TR-064 calls no
    longer occupy the host poll thread (F-32).
  * Each instance drives its own poll timer on its execution thread; the
    host-thread tick that raced with instance callbacks is gone (F-32).
  * Rebuild against phi-adapter-sdk 0.4.0 (AdapterFactory vtable change).

 -- Marius Schumacher <marius.schumacher@phisys.com>  Wed, 19 Aug 2026 16:49:03 +0200

